  "attestation": "This v2 population explicitly excludes GraphQL-unresolved REST IDs and audits each observed null. It does not repair or resume failed v1 checkpoints. All six frames share one live non-atomic public-ID traversal, and none may be substituted from Search or partial checkpoints. Publish this policy before inspecting v2 candidate identities, labels, or Sniff output."
